            <ol style="padding-left:7px;">

    <!-- 1 -->
    <li style="padding-left:0.5rem;">
        <p style="font-size:21px;">
            The Management of N-Stack is pleased to inform that you have been successful for allocation of a Residential Plot measuring
            <span class="pcategory"></span> (<span class="psqryard"></span> Square Yards) in Phase-<span class="pphase"></span>, N-Stack during the ballot held on
