        </p>
    </li>

    <!-- 3 -->
    <li style="padding-left:0.5rem;">
        <p style="font-size:21px;">
            You are requested to pay Rs. 
            <b><span class="ptotalAmount"></span></b>/- which includes Rs. 
            <span class="pdownPayment"></span>/- (Down Payment) and Rs. 
            <span class="pprocessingFee"></span>/- (Registration/Membership Fee + Misc Charges) by
                        <span class="pppdate"></span>. Please fill up the Registration / Membership form attached with this letter as per given instructions and return the same to this office by <span class="pppdate"></span>.
        </p>
    </li>

    <!-- 4 -->
    <li style="padding-left:0.5rem;">
        <p style="font-size:21px;">
            All Charges i.e Rs. <span class="ptotalAmount"></span>/- (Rupees <span class="pamountInWords"></span> Only) shall be paid to N-Stack through a Bank Draft / Pay Order in favour of “N-Stack” along with a covering letter containing the particulars of the applicant i.e complete Name as per CNIC, Father’s / Husband’s Name, CNIC Number / NICOP Number, complete mailing address and contact numbers besides 2 x passport size photographs in blue background along with 2 x duly attested copies of CNIC / NICOP.
        </p>
    </li>

    <!-- 5 -->
    <li style="padding-left:0.5rem;">
        <p style="font-size:21px;">
            Please find enclosed, 3 x optional payment plans attached as per Annexure A to this letter. Select the payment plan as per your convenience and dispatch the same for our record and subsequent actions.
        </p>
    </li>

    <!-- 6 -->
    <li style="padding-left:0.5rem;">
        <p style="font-size:21px;">
            All registered members are required to make payments as per the above mentioned schedule. A surcharge @@12% per annum for delay of each day shall be levied on the defaulted amount as per N-Stack by-laws.
        </p>
    </li>

    <!-- 7 -->
    <li style="padding-left:0.5rem;">
